# The actual 5x5 puzzle a player reported as having multiple solutions
# (Screenshot_20260913_093427). Transcribed from the drawn grid: the cage
# letters below follow the borders and the clues are read from the labeled
# cells. The clues alone admit exactly five grids, so a solver that has
# applied every deduction still faces a choice -- the defect this puzzle
# proves against real data rather than a reconstruction.
size 5
cages
aabbc
aabdc
eeedd
feggd
ffggh
clues
a 40*
b 11+
c 2/
d 15*
e 24*
f 12+
g 9+
h 5
